  insert into passages (title, body, "wordCount", difficulty, topic, status) values ('Urban Gardens', 'Community gardens are becoming more common in large cities. They provide fresh food, create green spaces, and encourage neighbors to cooperate. Although these gardens cannot solve every urban problem, they often improve local environments and strengthen social connections.
