  insert into passages (title, body, "wordCount", difficulty, topic, status) values ('Technology in Classrooms', 'Digital tools can make classroom learning more flexible, but technology alone does not guarantee success. Students benefit most when teachers choose tools that support clear goals. Without planning, devices may distract students rather than help them learn.
