  insert into passages (title, body, "wordCount", difficulty, topic, status) values ('Sleep and Performance', 'Sleep is essential for concentration and memory. People who sleep too little often make more mistakes and have difficulty solving complex problems. For students, regular sleep may be as important as extra hours of studying.
